    },
    "body": "Owner ruling 2026-10-01 04:14Z: local SmolLM2-Instruct **offline as a data source only, never serving**; wordings of relation statements/questions seeded with training phrasings only; development templates/n-grams screened out.\n\nThis PR adds `crates/uor-r4-training/examples/paraphrase-gen.rs`: draws relation seeds from the training-phrasing cells; samples with the local teacher; guards = empty, verbatim copy, question/statement kind change, invented or dropped values (digit runs, capitalized names), exact development-cell match, shared 4-word sequence; writes `paraphrase.jsonl` + sealed manifest (counts, teacher/tokenizer identity, hashes). Smoke (360M, temp 0.6): real paraphrases accepted, copies/inventions rejected. No training. Data-generation run follows its own card on #1552.",
